{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve `onInvocationEnd` when error serialization fails.** `buildErrorObject` now runs before the end hook, and only payload exceptions are caught. If a custom `SerDes` throws while encoding a handler exception, execution exits without an invocation-end event, leaking plugin spans or thread-local state; previously the FAILED event fired first. Emit FAILED for the original cause before rethrowing non-payload encoding failures, and add a lifecycle regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7onWOH","finding_digest":"4ca7c02e220031748d096bcbb960ba4f25db0506a41b7b3d733ffa01334b90e5","finding_id":"arf_v1_jst4alrcaayxjdijnpf3syf2j4","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::handleexecutionfailure::invocation-end-on-error-serdes-failure","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::handleexecutionfailure::invocation-end-on-error-serdes-failure","line":254,"observation_digest":"5895d886f1f9b415294bce9fd66dfd545feba97ac10690fffb6852c5e05209ad","observation_id":"aro_v1_lck5rbxr7g2bkkklz2p5m3p5kr","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T09:16:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uk25wro7hzsaazcmfdmuvbyu5a","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"6c619383c8c605b87c7b2560a8e94006013c7a34","reviewer":"codex","start_line":252,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_5yxnatgebq7gtgvmr2sqog5d3t","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T09:16:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
